/* 「今日打卡完成」弹窗：颜色与学习连胜页一致（橙 #FD7C02，冻结卡冰蓝，复活卡玫红）。 */
.cc-mask { position: fixed; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; z-index: 90; display: flex; padding: 32rpx; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(24, 28, 26, .46); animation: cc-fade .2s ease-out both; }
.cc-card { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 600rpx; max-height: 100%; padding: 48rpx 40rpx 34rpx; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-y: auto; border-radius: 48rpx; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFF3E2 0%, #FFFDF9 46%); color: #24332D; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 40rpx 100rpx rgba(40, 26, 10, .25); animation: cc-pop .42s cubic-bezier(.2,1.3,.4,1) both; }
.cc-close { position: absolute; top: 18rpx; right: 22rpx; padding: 8rpx 14rpx; color: #9CA39E; font-size: 44rpx; line-height: 1; }
.cc-glow { width: 180rpx; height: 180rpx; margin: 0 auto 12rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(253, 124, 2, .28) 0%, rgba(253, 124, 2, 0) 70%); }
.cc-flame { display: block; width: 180rpx; height: 180rpx; }
.cc-title { display: block; font-size: 40rpx; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1rpx; }
.cc-subtitle { display: block; margin-top: 10rpx; color: #6E5140; font-size: 26rpx; line-height: 1.45; }
.cc-rewards { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 14rpx; margin-top: 30rpx; }
.cc-reward { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6rpx; padding: 12rpx 22rpx; border-radius: 999rpx; background: #FFE7C0; color: #B25A00; font-size: 24rpx; animation: cc-pop .4s cubic-bezier(.2,1.3,.4,1) both; }
.cc-reward:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .08s; }
.cc-reward:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .16s; }
.cc-reward:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: .24s; }
.cc-reward-value { font-size: 30rpx; font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.cc-reward-icon { width: 32rpx; height: 32rpx; }
.cc-reward-coin { background: #FFF4C7; color: #A86A00; }
.cc-reward-freeze { background: #E3F2FF; color: #1F78C8; }
.cc-reward-revive { background: #FFE4EC; color: #D23F6C; }
.cc-pending { display: block; margin-top: 26rpx; color: #8B958E; font-size: 24rpx; }
.cc-primary { display: flex; height: 88rpx; margin-top: 38rpx; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 999rpx; background: #FD7C02; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.cc-secondary { display: flex; height: 84rpx; margin-top: 16rpx; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 999rpx; background: rgba(253, 124, 2, .1); color: #FD7C02; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.cc-primary:active, .cc-secondary:active { opacity: .8; }
@keyframes cc-fade { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes cc-pop { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.86) translateY(16rpx); } to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); } }

@import "./index.large.wxss"; /* 平板、电脑大屏样式：由 scripts/build-large-screen-styles.mjs 生成，改完本文件后重跑；这一行须留在文件末尾 */
